{"_v":1,"id":"barnum-1980","bd":{"positive":0,"mixed":0,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Paul Vale","o":"The Stage","s":42,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"http://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/review.php/38784/barnum","q":"In the end, any production of Barnum has to be about the spectacle, as there is very little substance to either the story or music. Despite the impressive credits of the creative team and the evident commitment of the company, modern audiences familiar with the spectacle of Cirque de Soleil or La Clique will simply find it wanting."}],"au":{"score":77,"designation":"Shrugging","sources":{"mz":{"s":77,"c":6,"sr":3.8}}},"pd":"1980-04-05","ca":[{"n":"Jim Dale","r":"Phineas Taylor Barnum"},{"n":"Glenn Close","r":"Chairy Barnum"},{"n":"Catherine Carr","r":"Lady Plate Balancer"},{"n":"Leonard John Crofoot","r":"Tom Thumb"},{"n":"Karen Gustafson","r":"Pianist"},{"n":"Steven Michael Harris","r":"One Man Band"},{"n":"Edward T. Jacobs","r":"Chief Bricklayer"},{"n":"Dirk Lumbard","r":"Sherwood Stratton"},{"n":"Terrence V. Mann","r":"Chester Lyman"},{"n":"Robbi Morgan","r":"Lady Aerialist"},{"n":"Barbara Nadel","r":"Lady Juggler"},{"n":"Peter Phillips","r":"Pianist"},{"n":"Bruce Robertson","r":"Wilton"},{"n":"Sophie Schwab","r":"Mrs. Sherwood Stratton"},{"n":"Bradley Steven-Fields","r":"Pre-Show Entertainer"},{"n":"Marianne Tatum","r":"Jenny Lind"},{"n":"Andy Teirstein","r":"White-Faced Clown"},{"n":"Karen Trott","r":"Susan B. Anthony"},{"n":"Kelly Walters","r":"Amos Scudder"},{"n":"Terri White","r":"Joice Heth"},{"n":"William C. Witter","r":"Ringmaster"}]}